      <abstract id="deafness-overview.Summary">
        <title>Summary</title>
        <p>The purpose of this <italic toggle="yes">GeneReview</italic> is to:</p>
        <p><list list-type="order"><list-item><label>1</label><p>Describe the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="deafness-overview.Audiometric_and_Clinic">audiometric and clinical aspects</xref> of genetic hearing loss;</p></list-item><list-item><label>2</label><p>Review the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="deafness-overview.Causes_of_Genetic_Hear">causes</xref> of genetic hearing loss;</p></list-item><list-item><label>3</label><p>Review the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="deafness-overview.Differential_Diagnosis">differential diagnosis</xref> of genetic hearing loss;</p></list-item><list-item><label>4</label><p>Explain the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="deafness-overview.Evaluation_Strategy">evaluation strategy</xref> to identify the genetic cause of hearing loss in a proband;</p></list-item><list-item><label>5</label><p>Review the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="deafness-overview.Management">management</xref> of genetic hearing loss;</p></list-item><list-item><label>6</label><p>Inform the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="deafness-overview.Genetic_Counseling">genetic counseling</xref> of an individual with genetic hearing loss and their family members.</p></list-item></list>
</p>
      </abstract>
